  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 401.04 Inactive Brand Codes. Vendors shall remove all products which do not have an active commission brand code from bailment within 60 days.\n\nSource. #7258, eff 5-2-00; ss by #8243, eff 12-31-04, EXPIRED: 12-31-12\n\nNew. #10322, INTERIM, eff 4-25-13, EXPIRED: 10-22-13\n\nNew. #10643, eff 7-18-14; ss by #14335, eff 8-2-25, EXPIRES: 8-2-35",
